<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: acidbulb -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.label>腐蝕瘤獸</FH_Acidbulb.label>
  <!-- EN: A giant bulbous fleshbeast swollen with corrosive fluids. It tears at nearby enemies with multiple tentacles and spits corrosive acid at distant targets. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.description>一種因腐蝕性體液而膨脹的巨型瘤狀血肉獸。它會用多條觸手撕扯近身敵人，並從遠處噴射腐蝕性酸液。</FH_Acidbulb.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows two tentacles that deal 10 blunt damage every 2 seconds. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長兩條觸手，每條造成10點鈍器傷害，攻擊冷卻2秒。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>觸手</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh mutualism mood -6; Social Impact -10%; Toxic Resistance +100%; twisted flesh capacity +200; grants two tentacles, acid mortar, and acid spray abilities. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；毒抗+100%；扭曲肉容量+200；提供兩條觸手、“酸蝕迫擊炮”和“酸液噴吐”主動能力。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-0.label>觸手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-1.label>觸手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-2.label>觸手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-2.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-3.label>觸手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-3.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-4.label>觸手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-4.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_Acidbulb.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: bulbfreak -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.label>惡臭瘤獸</FH_Bulbfreak.label>
  <!-- EN: A horrid oozing amalgamation of many smaller fleshbeasts, all controlled by a linked nervous system. It has two large claws which it uses to tear through its victims. Bulbfreaks are often smelled before they are seen, giving off an overwhelming odor of rancid meat. They are relatively slow and easy to kill, but once they die, they explode into a horde of smaller fleshbeasts. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.description>由許多小型血肉獸組成的可怕混合體，這些血肉獸都由同一個神經系統控制。它長著兩隻大爪子，可以撕碎受害者。惡臭瘤獸散發著一股令人作嘔的腐臭，在看到它本體之前，往往會先聞到這種噁心的味道。它的行動相對緩慢，也很容易被消滅，死後會分裂成一群小型血肉獸。</FH_Bulbfreak.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows two tentacles that deal 10 blunt damage every 2 seconds. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長兩條觸手，每條造成10點鈍器傷害，攻擊冷卻2秒。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>觸手</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh mutualism mood -6; Social Impact -10%; Global Work Speed +20%; twisted flesh capacity +300; grants two tentacles and the release fleshbeasts ability. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；全局工作效率+20%；扭曲肉容量+300；提供兩條觸手和“釋放血肉獸”主動能力。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-0.label>觸手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-1.label>觸手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-2.label>觸手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-2.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-3.label>觸手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-3.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-4.label>觸手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-4.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: bulbplump -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.label>增生瘤獸</FH_Bulbplump.label>
  <!-- EN: A terrifying amalgamation of many smaller fleshbeasts controlled by a single nervous system. Its body is covered in explosive sacs that store energy. In combat, it detonates these sacs to propel itself rapidly toward enemies. Fresh flesh continually grows across its body and can be harvested as a resource. It is relatively slow and easy to kill, but on death it erupts violently and splits into a horde of smaller fleshbeasts. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.description>由許多小型血肉獸組成的可怕混合體，這些血肉獸都由同一個神經系統控制。其身體上生長著許多儲能的爆炸囊，在戰鬥中會通過爆破快速抵達敵人附近。增生瘤獸的身體會不斷長出新鮮血肉，可以作為產出收集。它的行動相對緩慢，也很容易被消滅，死後會劇烈爆炸並分裂成一群小型血肉獸。</FH_Bulbplump.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Bulbplump.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows two tentacles that strike nearby enemies for 10 blunt damage every 2 seconds. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長兩條觸手，每條造成10點鈍器傷害，攻擊冷卻2秒。</FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>觸手</FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh mutualism mood -6; Social Impact -10%; hunger rate x50%; twisted flesh capacity +400; restores 50 twisted flesh per day; grants two tentacles. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；飢餓度×50%；扭曲肉容量+400；每天恢復50扭曲肉；提供兩條觸手。</FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-0.label>觸手</FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-1.label>觸手</FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_Bulbplump.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: Fingerspike -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.label>獨爪獸</FH_Fingerspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshy dog-sized creature with a single spiked limb. Despite their short legs, fingerspikes can move remarkably fast. -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.description>長著一根帶尖刺觸手的血肉獸，體型與犬類動物相當。儘管獨爪獸的腿很短，但移動速度非常快。</FH_Fingerspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Fingerspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows one bone-spike tentacle that deals 5 sharp damage every 2 seconds. -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長一條骨刺觸手，造成5點銳器傷害，攻擊冷卻2秒。</FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Bone-spike tentacle -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>骨刺觸手</FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Global Work Speed +10%; Social Impact -5%; Flesh mutualism mood -6; host grows one bone-spike tentacle -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>全局工作效率+10%；魅力-5%；“血肉寄生”心情-6；宿主生長一條骨刺觸手</FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.label>骨刺</FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.label>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>骨刺</FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_Fingerspike.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: Flesh replica -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.label>血肉擬像</FH_FleshReplica.label>
  <!-- EN: A humanoid fleshbeast covered in a small amount of carapace and roughly the size of an adult human. Flesh replicas can use human weapons, most of which are scavenged from the victims of fleshbeasts. After a flesh replica parasitizes a host, its original body remains independent and mimics the host's appearance. A flesh replica with a host can perform complex work just like a human. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.description>形似人類的血肉獸，覆蓋著少量甲殼，體型與成年人相當。血肉擬像可以使用人類的武器，這些武器大多是從血肉獸的受害者那裡掠奪而來的。血肉擬像寄生到宿主之後本體依然會保持獨立並且會模擬成宿主的外形，擁有宿主的血肉擬像可以像人類一樣進行復雜工作。</FH_FleshReplica.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_FleshReplica.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The flesh replica synchronizes with the host instead of living inside the host. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>血肉擬像與宿主同步，而不是寄居在宿主體內。</FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Synchronization: flesh replica -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>同步：血肉擬像</FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Synchronizes with the host. The flesh replica remains active and mirrors the host's skill levels. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>與宿主同步。血肉擬像會保留行動能力，並同步宿主的技能等級。</FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: fist -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.tools.fist.label>拳頭</FH_FleshReplica.tools.fist.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_FleshReplica.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: fleshwind -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.label>翼爪獸</FH_Fleshwind.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshbeast with huge spiked flying wings and a head covered in sharp keratinous plating. It is roughly the size of an adult human. Its loose, shifting structure allows it to fly through the air and quickly cross defensive fortifications. Fleshwind bodies are often host to smaller fleshbeasts; when the host dies, these parasites tear free, act independently, and attack. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.description>一種長有巨大骨刺飛翼、頭部覆蓋鋒利角質甲片的血肉獸，體型接近成年人。它鬆散而不斷變形的身體結構使其能夠飛越空中，迅速跨過防禦工事。翼爪獸體內常寄宿著更小的血肉獸；宿主死亡後，這些寄生體會撕開軀體脫離，獨立行動併發起攻擊。</FH_Fleshwind.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Fleshwind.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host ignores terrain movement penalties and has 120% Move Speed. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主無視地形移動阻攔，移動速度×120%。</FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic adaptation: fleshwind mobility -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生適應：翼爪獸機動性</FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Terrain movement impedance x0; Move Speed x120% -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>地形移動阻攔係數×0；移動速度×120%</FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: left wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.label>左翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: right wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.label>右翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: horned head -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.label>角質頭部</FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.label>
  <!-- EN: horned head -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.labelNoLocation>角質頭部</FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.labelNoLocation>

  <!-- EN: gutspike -->
  <FH_Gutspike.label>胃血獸</FH_Gutspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A small fleshbeast with a specialized stomach, roughly the size of a dog. Its stomach stores corrosive acid and rapidly compresses to spray the fluid at enemies. Its frail body is poorly suited for close combat, so gutspikes usually rely on numbers to launch ranged attacks. -->
  <FH_Gutspike.description>一隻擁有胃部特化的小型血肉獸，體型與犬類動物相當。特化的胃部可以用來儲存酸液，並且通過快速擠壓胃部來將這些腐蝕性酸液噴吐而出。其孱弱的身體並不擅長近距離戰鬥，通常依靠數量優勢進行遠距離襲擊。</FH_Gutspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Gutspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Spits corrosive fluid. -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>噴射腐蝕性酸液。</FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic weapon: acid launch -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生武器：酸液投射</FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Food poisoning chance x0%; Immunity: gut worms; Pain +8% -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>食物中毒係數×0%；抗感染：腸道蠕蟲；疼痛+8%</FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: teeth -->
  <FH_Gutspike.tools.teeth.label>牙齒</FH_Gutspike.tools.teeth.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Gutspike.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_Gutspike.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: paraspike -->
  <FH_Paraspike.label>寄血獸</FH_Paraspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A small fleshbeast specialized for mutualism, roughly the size of a dog. It can fire a parasitic stinger into a victim, causing tiny internal wounds that continue to bleed. Each paraspike has only one stinger and soon dies after firing it. Paraspikes can also actively parasitize other animals and emerge when the host dies. -->
  <FH_Paraspike.description>一隻特化了寄生能力的小型血肉獸，體型與犬類動物相當。它可以將寄生毒刺發射到受害者體內，並且持續從內部造成流血的微型傷口，但是每隻寄血獸只有一枚寄生毒刺，發射之後原本的寄血獸就會很快死亡。寄血獸可以主動寄生在其他動物身上，並在宿主死亡時脫離。</FH_Paraspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Paraspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows one spiral tentacle that deals 5 sharp damage every 3 seconds with 40% armor penetration. -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長一條螺旋觸手，造成5點銳器傷害，攻擊冷卻3秒，護甲穿透40%。</FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Spiral tentacle -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>螺旋觸手</FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Bleeding rate x75%; Immunity: wound infection; Social Impact -5%; Pain +6%; host grows one spiral tentacle; offspring inherit paraspike mutualism -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>失血速率×75%；魅力-5%；抗感染：感染；疼痛+6%；宿主生長一條螺旋觸手；後代繼承寄血獸寄生效果</FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Paraspike.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_Paraspike.tools.head.label>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.label>骨刺</FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.label>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>骨刺</FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>

  <!-- EN: puffspike -->
  <FH_Puffspike.label>肺血獸</FH_Puffspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A small fleshbeast with specialized lungs, roughly the size of a dog. Its powerful oxygenation system allows it to move at extreme speed, but its frail body is poorly suited for combat. Puffspikes usually serve as haulers, working busily around flesh hives. -->
  <FH_Puffspike.description>一隻擁有肺部特化的小型血肉獸，體型與犬類動物相當。強大的供氧系統可以使其以極快的速度移動，但是其孱弱的身體並不擅長戰鬥，通常作為巢穴的搬運工忙碌於血肉巢穴附近。</FH_Puffspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Puffspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host gains immunity to asthma and lung rot and becomes more tolerant of toxic environments. -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主獲得哮喘與肺瘟免疫，並更耐受毒性環境。</FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic adaptation: pulmonary immunity -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生適應：肺部免疫</FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Immune to asthma and lung rot and cures them in the host's lungs; Move Speed +10%; Toxic Resistance +30%; Pain +6%; twisted flesh capacity +50 -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>完全免疫哮喘和肺瘟，並會治癒宿主肺中的這些疾病；移動速度+10%；有毒環境抗性+30%；疼痛+6%；扭曲肉容量+50</FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Puffspike.tools.head.label>頭部</FH_Puffspike.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: shatterspike -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.label>碎爪獸</FH_Shatterspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A man-sized fleshbeast covered in brittle but razor-sharp bone spikes. It launches volleys of bone fragments from range, tearing targets apart with dense barrages. -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.description>一種體型接近成年人的血肉獸，軀體上遍佈易碎卻鋒利的骨刺。它能夠從遠處發射成片的骨刺碎片，以密集射擊撕裂目標。</FH_Shatterspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突變而來。</FH_Shatterspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows one shatter-claw tentacle that fires bone shards for 18 sharp damage with 100% armor penetration, 1-second aiming, a 1.5-second cooldown, 16-cell range, 55 projectile speed, and 3 stopping power. -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長一條碎爪觸手，遠程發射骨刺碎片，造成18點銳器傷害，護甲穿透100%，瞄準1秒，攻擊冷卻1.5秒，射程16格，彈速55，抑制能力3。</FH_Shatterspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Shatter-claw tentacle -->
